00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:21.470
where in 2016, 2017, Trump wanted Garth Brooks
and Garth Brooks said, sorry, I have a scheduling

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:22.470
conflict.

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:24.530
And it wasn't really clear whether he did.

00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:28.910
