00:02:34.989 --> 00:02:36.659
So I think Biden did a good job.

00:02:36.659 --> 00:02:39.970
I don't think it'll go anywhere.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:45.099
And one last question before I let you go,
what do you think just sort of as a normal

00:02:45.099 --> 00:02:54.719
